# claude-faf-mcp (GHSA-rr55-jp92-8wp2) vulnerable: npm claude-faf-mcp 5.7.1, the last release the
# advisory lists as affected. faf_read/faf_write resolve their `path` argument with only a
# denylist check, so a path outside the project reaches any file the server's user can read.
# Same /work project (the server's published sample, pinned) as the patched image, so only the
# server version differs. No local COPY/ADD.
